            <!-- <div class="text-center">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4">Join Our Research Community</h3>
              <p class="text-neutral-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Applications are now open for all programs. Connect with us to explore how the IITB-Citadel Securities
                Quantitative Research Lab can advance your academic or professional journey.
              </p>
              <button id="programApplyBtn"
